      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. i want to make sure the students really grasp the inevitability of it. can you write a section that explains why these systemic issues are basically impossible to solve just through individual effort or \"working harder\"? like, how can i show them that the system itself makes meritocracy a myth in these specific sectors?",
